  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 306.05 Special Permit Provisions for Sudden Termination of Pharmacist-In-Charge (PIC). Existing pharmacy permit holders who have a sudden loss of the pharmacist-in-charge (PIC), shall be issued a special pharmacy permit valid for 60 days while a new PIC is identified and appears before the board according to Ph 305.01.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16",
